  "question": {
    "text": "A mosquito $O$ is sitting infront of a glass rod having spherical end of radius of curvature $40 \\mathrm{~cm}$. The image would be formed at\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/weLGNMYc7iY8HKVyLvwJjxS4kZCrETIc0bLDHgLJXiY.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "vd8Hd",
      "text": "\r\n$40 \\mathrm{~cm}$ left\r\n",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hsQT3",
      "text": "\r\ninfinity\r\n",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "6om1p",
      "text": "\r\n$20 \\mathrm{~cm}$ to the right\r\n",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "t1hhQ",
      "text": "\r\n$15 \\mathrm{~cm}$ to the left",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "As, we know, $\\frac{\\mu_2}{v}-\\frac{\\mu_1}{u}=\\frac{\\mu_2-\\mu_1}{R}$\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n& \\Rightarrow \\quad \\frac{1.5}{v}-\\frac{1}{(-20)}=\\frac{1.5-1}{+40} \\\\\r\n& v=-40 \\mathrm{~cm} \\\\\r\n&\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\r\nNegative sign shows that image is obtained on the same side of object i.e., towards left.",
